WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.661
Varifolds, regular almost everywhere.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.162
Two crossing planes meet along a line.

3
00:00:05.162 --> 00:00:07.024
Can the bad set ever have area?

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.305
Zoom in at each point, keeping height

5
00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:13.309
and slope, and the picture is regular.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.324
Claimed: never; one dimension lower at most.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.844
Not in Lean.
